    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm looking at expanding our sourcing for some electronic components. we're deciding between setting up new supplier partnerships in vietnam or nigeria. can you give me a breakdown of the general business culture and reliability we can expect from suppliers in those two places?",
