    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. can you be a bit more specific about those 'complexities' in nigeria though? i'm trying to get a sense of whether there are common issues with things like contract enforcement or just general work ethic/reliability compared to the vietnamese model. like, is it an inherent part of the business environment there?",
